    "MIGRATED (July 2026) — and it was the LAST `same-origin` holder, so the whole registry is now sandboxed. Found because the ROBBAMP tile was DEAD on the TV root: the root (correctly) holds no escape hatch, attenuation refused the spawn, and 27 winampesque visualizer modes were unreachable from the surface built for lean-back listening. danbri asked where the visualizations went; this line is where. app-sdk now fronts robbin's 24 bare localStorage calls (probe: standalone keeps native storage)."
